NOTE ON AUDIO

Every notification sound is composed in code (src/main/soundSynth.ts) and is
original to this fork, offered under the same MIT terms. No recorded audio, and
no sample taken from a recording, ships with the app or is part of this
repository.

A person can put a WAV file of their own, named for a cue (completed.wav and so
on), in the app's data folder under sounds/custom/ to hear it instead of the
app's own sound for that cue, on their own machine. The app never writes to that
folder, and nothing in it is part of the app or of any installer.
